+### [Laplacian Regularization](10293-laplacian-regularization.md)
+[Laplacian Regularization](10293-laplacian-regularization.md): Enforces spatial smoothness on volume properties by penalizing their Laplacian, addressing the ill-posed nature of sparse-view tomographic reconstruction [G]. It distinguishes itself from standard Tikhonov regularization by directly penalizing second-order spatial derivatives (curvature) rather than first-order gradients, which better preserves sharp features while suppressing high-frequency noise [G]. Choose it when second-order smoothness constraints are preferred over first-order gradient penalties.
